@@ -8,6 +8,10 @@ package, not for somebody reading this repository's commit log.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- `ToolRegistry.execute` now validates tool input against the tool's declared `inputSchema` before calling the executor. Invalid input returns a `ToolResponse` whose `result` names the failing field paths and expected types so the model can correct the call; the executor is never invoked on a schema-rejected call. Static schemas are compiled once at registration time (a broken schema throws at startup, naming the tool); function-valued schemas are compiled per call and cached. Extra properties pass through unchanged.
+
